WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.892 --> 00:00:19.707
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.707 --> 00:00:27.137
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.137 --> 00:00:30.326
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.326 --> 00:00:34.563
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.563 --> 00:00:40.232
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.232 --> 00:00:45.725
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.725 --> 00:00:51.460
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:57.891
The Time column says how long each person has been in class.

9
00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:03.503
It counts up on its own while they are here.

10
00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:08.472
Past an hour it turns amber.

11
00:01:08.472 --> 00:01:16.734
Past an hour and a half, red — they have probably left without checking out.

12
00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:25.267
Once someone checks out, the time stops and stays plain.
